    "rule": "The normal dependencies of the ripgrep package for that target and feature set, resolved the way Cargo resolves them from the locked versions: the checksum of every locked crate equals the one in the crates.io index, dependencies come from the index (kind, target cfg, optional, features) and ripgrep's workspace manifests. Dev-dependencies, build-dependencies, other targets and optional crates that no enabled feature reaches are not part of rg.exe (notLinked).",
